Keep uv's cache on the workspace volume in the Windows build

On GitHub's Windows runners the checkout lands on D: while uv's default
cache is on C:, so uv cannot hardlink into the build tree and warns that
it is falling back to full copies. Pointing the cache at the workspace
puts both on one volume.

diff --git a/.github/workflows/windows.yml b/.github/workflows/windows.yml
--- a/.github/workflows/windows.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/windows.yml
@@ -11,6 +11,10 @@
 
 env:
   FORCE_COLOR: 1
+  # Keep uv's cache on the same volume as the workspace. The runner's
+  # default cache lives on C: while the checkout is on D:, so uv cannot
+  # hardlink into the build tree and falls back to full copies.
+  UV_CACHE_DIR: ${{ github.workspace }}/.uv-cache
 
 permissions: { }
 
